# Generated by .claude/hooks/session-stop.sh on every Stop and .claude/hooks/pre-compact.sh
# on every compaction — necessarily *after* the session's last commit, so tracking them
# left the tree dirty at the end of every session with nothing to do about it but make
# one more commit that the next append dirtied again. Only these generated files:
# hand-authored playtest records live in the same directory and are expected in version
# control by the qa-plan, story-done and test-evidence-review skills.
production/session-logs/session-log.md
production/session-logs/compaction-log.txt
